# Empty on purpose.
#
# frontend/.gitignore lists `dist`, and npm honours a nested .gitignore over
# the root package.json "files" whitelist — which silently left frontend/dist
# out of the published tarball, so `syflo` could only ever report
# frontend-missing (measured 2026-08-21). An .npmignore overrides that
# .gitignore for npm while git keeps ignoring dist.
